bashscp ServerData/kevin.sqlite kevin@67.205.173.18:/srv/shiny-server/kevin/ServerData/
ssh kevin@67.205.173.18 "sudo chmod 664 /srv/shiny-server/kevin/ServerData/kevin.sqlite"
Or have SCP preserve target permissions instead of source via a wrapper, but the chmod approach is more explicit and easier to read later.


